    skos:prefLabel 'N-butylbenzenesulfonamide'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A sulfonamide that is benzenesulfonamide substituted by a butyl group at the nitrogen atom. It has been isolated from the plant Prunus africana and has been shown to exhibit antiandrogenic activity. Molecular formula C10H15NO2S.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S27::CS004593'^^xsd:string .
